# Only keycloak/Dockerfile is built with the repository root as its context,
# and it needs exactly one file from it: the OneID provider jar.
#
# Everything else stays out of the build context. That keeps node_modules and
# every target directory from being sent to Docker, and keeps .env, which holds
# secrets, out of any image layer.
*
!oneid-identity-provider/target/oneid-identity-provider-*.jar
